  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "A moment later, Nina is packing Samsonov's small suitcase in their communal apartment. She mockingly puts in his metal flask for his upcoming bachelor life. Remembering Arkady's advice, Samsonov attempts an intense ten-second stare to intimidate her, but the psychological tactic fails completely. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Фляжка, конечно!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Как же в холостяцкую жизнь без фляжки?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Так, надо смотреть тяжело.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "По-мужски, ровно десять секунд.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Один, два, три...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Чего ты уставился?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Четыре, пять, шесть...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "У тебя нервный тик?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Живот крутит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Так сходи в туалет!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Не терпи, Самсон.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я не в туалет иду!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я ухожу навсегда!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Иди, скатертью дорожка!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's examine Samsonov's failed intimidation tactic line by line. Nina packs his bag while Samsonov attempts an intense stare.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Фляжка, конечно!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A flask, of course!' Nina sarcastically adds a drinking flask to Samsonov's bag.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Как же в холостяцкую жизнь без фляжки?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How can you start bachelor life without a flask?' The preposition takes the accusative case for destination.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Так, надо смотреть тяжело.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, I need to stare intensely.' The modal word combines with an infinitive to express necessity.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "По-мужски, ровно десять секунд.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Like a real man, exactly ten seconds.' Samsonov reminds himself of Arkady's psychological advice.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Один, два, три...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One, two, three...' Samsonov counts the seconds mentally to reach ten.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Чего ты уставился?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you staring at?' The colloquial verb expresses surprise at his strange facial expression.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Четыре, пять, шесть...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Four, five, six...' The husband continues counting under his breath despite her question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "У тебя нервный тик?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have a nervous tic?' Nina mocks his twitching facial expression.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Живот крутит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My stomach is acting up.' The reflexive colloquial idiom describes an upset stomach.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Так сходи в туалет!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then go to the bathroom!' The imperative verb directs him to the communal restroom.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Не терпи, Самсон.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't hold it in, Samson.' The negative imperative advises him not to endure discomfort.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я не в туалет иду!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not going to the bathroom!' Samsonov furiously rejects her domestic interpretation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я ухожу навсегда!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am leaving forever!' The present tense verb expresses definite future departure.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Иди, скатертью дорожка!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go, and good riddance!' Nina dismisses him with a traditional Russian parting idiom. Now let's listen to Nina and Samsonov's exchange one more time without pauses.",
      "gap": 0.9
